                                "sense_id": "4c35025c-a823-3191-98a4-f3f85b6c20f7",
                                "text": "I am not what I seemed to her, he thought, and doubtless she is not what she seemed to me, but it is our lot to be irrevocably condemned to seemings and to deserve them too."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "298121c5-910e-3352-9ed3-e6f824e4eadb",
