                                "sense_id": "298121c5-910e-3352-9ed3-e6f824e4eadb",
                                "text": "Nothing more cleare vnto their seeming, then that a new Jerusalem being often spoken of in Scripture, they vndoubtedly were themselues that newe Ierusalem,"
